2; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">期货第一梯队<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 150%; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">公司注册资本<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">76亿元，各项业务稳健发展，客户保证金、营业收入和净利润等核心经营指标均位居行业前列。202<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">5<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">年<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">12月末客户保证金规模达<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">2130<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">亿元。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 150%; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><strong><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">专业服务团队<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 150%; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">公司拥有强大、专业的投研、技术、市场、运营团队。共有逾<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2000名员工，其中硕士及以上学历占4<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">9<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">%，具有海外背景的占<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\">32<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">%。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 150%; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><strong><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">全面业务牌照<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 150%; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">除商品期货经纪、金融期货经纪、期货交易咨询、资产管理、基金销售等业务资格外，下设子公司可提供风险管理、期现业务、境外衍生品经纪及交易咨询等服务。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 150%; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"> <\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 150%; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><strong><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">二、中信期货<\/span><\/span><\/strong><strong><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">西部<\/span><\/span><\/strong><strong><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 14pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">分公司简介：<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">西部<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">分公司（以下简称<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">“分公司”）成立于<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2013<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">年<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">1<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">月<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">22日<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">，坐落于<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">陕西省<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">西安市高新区唐延路<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">11号禾盛京广中心A栋904室，是中信期货在<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">西北<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">地区设立的区域分公司，地理位置优越，交通便捷，下辖<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">甘肃分公司、宁夏<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">分公司、<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">新疆<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">分公司<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">、<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">内蒙古分公司<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">共<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">四<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">家一级分支机构。分公司本部现有员工<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">二十<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">余人，设有<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">机构客户<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">部等二级部门，业务范围立足<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">西部<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">地区，辐射全国。分公司始终坚持全产业链覆盖，以经纪业务为抓手，并积极探索多元化创新型业务模式，致力于成为管理规范、具有独特竞争优势和鲜明特色的地区经营机构。分公司秉承中信核心价值理念，通过专业、及时、高效的服务，在机构、产业和财富管理等方面，满足客户对综合金融服务的需求。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 24pt; line-height: 150%; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; line-height: 150%; font-size: 12pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">未来，分公司将继承发扬中信优良传统，借助中信集团成员企业内部大协同优势，深度挖掘客户的多元业务需求，不断提升服务水平，为地方政府，产业企业，金融机构以及高净值人士等各类客群提供全方位的产融服务，实现分公司的高质量可持续发展。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"> <\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><strong><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">三、招聘需求<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>岗位职责:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>1、掌握公司业务知识、培养专业思维方式及良好工作习惯，了解行业与业务的基本发展现状、掌握基本的营销技巧以及公司各项规章制度；<br \/>2、围绕市场研究、需求分析、方案设计、客户服务等工作内容，为客户提供全生命周期的综合金融服务方案，实现客户资产的保值增值及风险管理；<br \/>3、努力成为产业业务、机构业务、财富管理等一个或多个相关业务领域的未来业务骨干、后备干部，在客户开发服务过程体现行业价值及自身从业价值；<br \/>4、参加业务、合规与反洗钱培训学习，落实工作范围内的反洗钱要求及相关宣传和保密工作；<br \/>5、完成上级部门、领导布置的各项工作任务。<\/p>\n<p><strong>岗位要求:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>1、2027届应届毕业生（境内院校毕业时间：2026年9月-2027年8月；境外院校毕业时间：2026年1月-2027年8月），本科及以上学历，理工类、经济金融类、财务管理类或与期货品种相关专业优先；<\/p>\n<p>2、积极主动，富有激情，乐观开朗，诚实正直，亲和力强，善于沟通交际；<\/p>\n<p>3、具备良好的职业道德、学习能力和专业素质、客户服务意识、团队合作精神与责任感； <\/p>\n<p>4、对期货行业有所了解及浓厚兴趣，认同期货行业未来前景和行业价值；<\/p>\n<p>5、通过期货从业资格、基金从业资格、证券从业资格考试优先，有期货、证券、银行实习经历优先。<\/p>\n<p><strong>四、薪酬福利：<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>薪资待遇：<\/strong>具有竞争力的薪酬和激励体系、六险两金（补充保险\/企业年金）<\/p>\n<p><strong>培养体系：<\/strong>专属的培训赋能计划、全面系统的培训体系<\/p>\n<p><strong>晋升机制：<\/strong>明确清晰的职业发展路径，专业型、管理型成长双通道<\/p>\n<p><strong>贴心福利：<\/strong>过节费、工会福利、餐补、通讯补贴、带薪休假、休市假期等<\/p>\n<p><strong>五、简历投递<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>PC端：<a href=\"https:\/\/campus.yingjiesheng.com\/citicsf\/fenzhi.html\">https:\/\/campus.yingjiesheng.com\/citicsf\/fenzhi.html<\/a> <\/p>\n<p>移动端：<\/p>\n<p><img src=\"\/\/jymnjep1.jiuyeb.cn\/2026\/09\/14\/1789368038-58f6724852-4022-4ec6-b1cf-81c0f043c3d4.png!y\" \/><\/p>","isdeliver":1,"status":1,"jobInfo":{"id":"ec2187bf-7e74-a9c0-bb87-a8666491e347","jobtype":1,"work_name":"业务管理培训生","dalei_id":"64bf4dfe-f3d8-82df-2868-33ab5c672df3","cate_id1":"a549d194-2e1c-51f0-9134-e148a970e38d","cate_id2":"92fda188-110f-20da-0917-c115d8ddd986","province_id":61,"city_id":6101,"district_id":0,"isday":0,"salary_floor":6000,"salay_ceil":7999,"status":1,"create_id":"04af378d-6ba3-e36a-93f8-32a1f840bf82","addtime":1789368765,"person_count":"5人","com_id":"5fe59443-a319-fa77-bdf9-12230d171323","com_id_name":"中信期货有限公司西部分公司","label":"","xueli_id":"3cc6e5cf-0b81-7e83-8322-fe0273871ab0","laiyuan":2,"sharetype":0,"viewcount":149,"complaint":0,"work_days":"","practice_month":"","chance":3,"isedit":2,"resume_count":0,"expire_time":0,"address":"陕西省西安市高新区唐延路11号禾盛京广中心A座904","start_time":0,"end_time":0,"teacher_business":"",